Z||000000||DR650SE||10-29-2001||11:32 PM||||SOme time soon I think I may need to get my car e-checked.  I hope it isn't as bad as it went last time.  The person who put my car pn there machines had no idead how to drive a stick.  THe had the car in 4th gear trying to get it to move and then when it was on the roolers they revved it and stalled it a bunch and wound't let me drive it.  They finally got it started in 2nd gear.  makes me want to scream!!  I beat that didn't help the clutch and several months I had to replace the clutch. mostly cuz i drove hard on it and taught my bro to drive a stick.  He is better now and knows how to drive so i wont have that prob.  Pray for all those how need to get e-checks by incompetant people.<BR>Thanks for letting me vent.<BR>                          Dan Tillman<P>------------------<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD||||reg||9
