Z||000006||DR650SE||10-30-2001||11:52 PM||||AAAAAARRRRRRRRRRRRRRRGGGGGGGGGGGGGHHHHHHHHHHH<BR>I just got the damn E-check.  The moron got the car to the rollers ok.  I was impressed be cause he found 1st gear on a short throw.  The last time the person couldn't do that.  Then once on the rollers he burned on the damn clutch till the car could spin the tires.  HE burned all the way throught 3rd gear.  I already got done replacing the clutch on my other car.  It is something I'm not ready to tackle again quite yet.  Damn laws.  Thanks for letting me vent.  <BR><P>------------------<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD||||reg||8
